    "detailed_description": "Game Description:<br />\r\nThird-person perspective 3D points game, achieve points to eliminate BOSS, easy to operate. Watch out for zombies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nMove: W/S/A/D<br />\r\nShoot the Explosive Ball: Left mouse button<br />\r\nRotate the view: Right-click<br />\r\nSuspension: ESC<br />\r\nLens distance: Mouse wheel<br />\r\nToggle Full Screen/Window: F11<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClearance Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Destroy the boss after the points are reached.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame End Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Loss of HP.<br />\r\n2. Close the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: Progress cannot be saved, only the player is paused when the game is paused! Happy gaming!",
